Dialogue: 10,0:00:28.67,0:00:31.46,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Are you asleep? Don't tell me you're still sleeping!}¿Durmiendo? ¡¿Cómo que todavía estás durmiendo?!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:31.46,0:00:33.76,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Come on, Kou! Wake up!}¡Vamos, Kou! ¡Levántate!{abre}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:35.22,0:00:37.35,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I bet you just got out of bed.}Seguramente acabas de salir de la cama.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:37.35,0:00:39.76,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I even called to make sure you woke—}Hasta te llamé para asegurarme de que despertaras—
Dialogue: 10,0:00:43.06,0:00:45.69,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You're such a nag.}Qué molesta eres.{:F}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:49.23,0:00:51.28,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Why are you naked?!}¡¿Por qué estás desnudo?!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:10.30,0:01:12.63,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I didn't come here for that!}¡No vine aquí para eso!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:12.96,0:01:15.80,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Huh? Is your brain working?}¿Eh? ¿Te sientes bien?{baka )?}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:17.05,0:01:19.80,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Who would even want to lay a hand on you?}¿Quién sería capaz de ponerte una mano encima?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:19.80,0:01:22.31,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You woke the whole town up with your screaming.}Estabas despertando a mediomundo con tus gritos.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:22.31,0:01:24.39,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{B-B-But, naked!}¡P-P-Pero estás desnudo!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:24.39,0:01:26.48,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I was about to shower.}Estaba a punto de bañarme.{ducharme}{retimed; false keyframe}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:28.44,0:01:29.52,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I was so off!}¡Me equivoqué!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:30.11,0:01:32.36,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Please just kill me!}¡Dios, qué vergüenza!{a menos que la quieran matar ustedes )?}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:33.74,0:01:37.66,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Wait, you're gonna shower now? There's no time!}Espera, ¿te ducharás ahora? ¡No hay tiempo!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:37.66,0:01:39.45,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You worry too much.}Te preocupas demasiado.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:39.45,0:01:40.83,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Just wait in here.}Simplemente espera aquí.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:40.83,0:01:42.91,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Then get a move on!}¡Entonces muévete!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:43.24,0:01:45.25,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{That hurt, you know.}Qué molesta.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:47.62,0:01:49.54,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Kou's bare skin.}La piel desnuda de Kou.{:winky:}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:50.08,0:01:52.42,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I did not mean to do that.}No tenía la intención de hacer eso.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:52.42,0:01:56.13,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,S-Se sintió muy suave.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:57.09,0:01:59.84,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Does he use product or something?}¿Usará algún producto o algo por el estilo?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:11.15,0:02:13.19,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Esto está bastante ordenado.
