Dialogue: 10,0:02:45.35,0:02:48.43,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I like having a bit extra ti—}Me gusta tener un poco de tie—
Dialogue: 10,0:02:48.43,0:02:49.31,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What?}¿Qué?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:52.61,0:02:54.86,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I can't believe you left your bag at my house!}¡No puedo creer que hayas dejado tu bolso en mi casa!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:54.86,0:02:56.28,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Forgive me!}¡Perdón!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:56.73,0:02:59.57,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Stop slacking, Kou! Hurry it up!}¡¿Qué estás haciendo, Kou?!{escucho eso} ¡Apúrate!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:59.57,0:03:02.03,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Why don't you try running with this?!}¡Intenta correr con este bolso!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:07.37,0:03:08.83,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{The train's leaving!}¡El tren se va!{¡Se nos pela el tren!}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:08.83,0:03:10.62,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Guess we'll have to wait.}Supongo que tendremos que esperar.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:10.62,0:03:11.79,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Let's grab the next one.}Tomaremos el siguiente.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:12.42,0:03:14.75,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Don't you give up on me!}¡No te des por vencido!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:18.97,0:03:20.68,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Made it...}Lo logramos...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:21.80,0:03:24.68,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Where were we meeting up again...}Veamos, debemos encontrarnos en...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:25.47,0:03:28.98,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Pretty sure it was Oosakigaoka Station.}Estoy segura que era en la estación Oosakigaoka.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:29.48,0:03:31.77,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Oosakigaoka's in the other direction.}Oosakigaoka es en la otra dirección.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:34.27,0:03:39.24,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I messed up! I got on the train I take to school out of habit!}¡Lo arruiné! ¡Me subí al tren que tomo para ir a la escuela normalmente!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:39.24,0:03:42.91,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{This one's a super express train, so we'll be stuck here for a while.}Este es un tren súper expreso, \Nestaremos estancados aquí por un rato.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:44.62,0:03:48.12,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Sorry, Yuuri!\fad(0,220)}¡Perdón, Yuuri!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:48.91,0:03:51.58,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Hello, Futaba-chan? Where are you?}¿Hola, Futaba-chan? ¿Dónde te encuentras?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:51.58,0:03:55.59,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Sorry! I bet everyone's already there!}¡Perdón! ¡Seguramente todos ya están ahí!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:55.59,0:03:59.55,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Tanaka-sensei, I know that blaming you won't get me anywhere,}Tanaka-sensei, ya sé que con \Nculparle no solucionamos nada,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:00.09,0:04:03.26,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{but you need to keep a closer eye on your students!}¡pero necesita controlar mejor a sus alumnos!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:03.26,0:04:05.51,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'm really sorry.}Realmente lo lamento.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:05.51,0:04:10.14,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Well I'm not waiting! Tell them to find a map and get there themselves!}¡Yo no esperaré más! ¡Dígales que encuentren un mapa y lleguen allí por sí mismos!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:10.14,0:04:12.69,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Did you hear that?}¿Escuchaste eso?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:17.32,0:04:20.65,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I feel spent already.}Me siento agotada.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:20.65,0:04:22.95,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{That's what I want to say.}Eso iba a decir yo.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:26.37,0:04:28.20,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Kou, go ahead and nap.}Kou, puedes tomar una siesta.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:28.79,0:04:30.58,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You don't mind?}¿No te importa?{¿En serio dices?}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:30.58,0:04:33.83,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Yeah, I'll wake you when we get there.}Sí, te despertaré cuando lleguemos.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:33.83,0:04:36.33,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'll take you up on that.}Bueno, confiaré en ti.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:40.05,0:04:42.59,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{This girl's unbelievable.}Esta chica es increíble.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:12.97,0:06:17.44,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You two... make sure this is the last time!}Ustedes dos... ¡que esta sea la última vez!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:17.44,0:06:18.77,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Yes...}Sí...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:18.77,0:06:19.52,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Right.}Sí.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:20.19,0:06:23.27,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Now get your butts changed and go get some lunch.}¡Vamos! Vayan a cambiarse de ropa y luego a almorzar.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:23.27,0:06:25.53,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'm really sorry...}Realmente lo sentimos...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:36.08,0:06:37.66,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Por Dios, con ustedes...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:37.66,0:06:43.71,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{\q2\When both of our class reps are late, we're the ones who look bad!}¡Si nuestros dos representantes llegan tarde,\N somos nosotros los que damos mala impresión!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:43.71,0:06:46.59,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Yeah... sorry again.}Sí... perdón.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:47.92,0:06:48.84,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kou.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:49.72,0:06:53.01,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You're going to have to write an essay reflecting on why you were late.}Escribirás un ensayo concerniente a tu llegada tarde.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:53.01,0:06:55.93,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Bring it in before lights-out.}Entrégalo antes de que se apaguen las luces.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:57.73,0:06:59.48,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You too, Yoshioka.}También tú, Yoshioka.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:59.48,0:07:01.10,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Uh, right...}Oh, claro...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:04.15,0:07:07.69,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Christ, now I've gotta write an essay...}Rayos, ¿por qué tengo que escribir un ensayo?{~}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:09.11,0:07:13.82,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{When you cause trouble like this, it reflects badly on Tanaka-sensei as well.}Cuando creas problemas como este, \Nhaces quedar mal a Tanaka-sensei.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:13.82,0:07:16.29,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Watch yourself from now on.}Sé más cuidadoso de ahora en adelante.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:16.87,0:07:19.50,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Whatever, he's fine.}Claro, como digas.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:20.29,0:07:23.50,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{It's my business. He has nothing to do with it.}Es mi problema. Él no tiene nada que ver con{en} esto.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:24.00,0:07:27.67,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{He has nothing to do with it, yet he had to apologize on your behalf?}¿No tuvo nada que ver, pero tuvo que disculparse por ti?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:28.09,0:07:29.01,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You child.}Niñato.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:31.05,0:07:32.51,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{No, wait...}No, mejor dicho...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:32.51,0:07:33.93,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Spoiled brat.}Mocoso insolente...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:36.56,0:07:39.14,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,¿M-Murao-san?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:39.14,0:07:44.98,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{O-Oh yeah! I was really surprised that you volunteered to be an event planner.}¡A-Ah, sí! Realmente me sorprendió que te \Nofrecieras para ser una organizadora de eventos.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:44.98,0:07:47.07,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Do you like this kind of thing?}¿Te gustan este tipo de cosas?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:47.07,0:07:48.15,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Not really.}Para nada.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:48.94,0:07:51.53,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Then why'd you do it?!}¡¿Entonces por qué lo hiciste?!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:51.53,0:07:57.03,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You've got a big mouth for someone so bad at talking to people.}Para alguien que es tan mala conversando con otros, has hablado bastante.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:57.03,0:07:57.95,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Hey!}¡Oye!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:58.62,0:08:02.12,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Don't talk to girls like that.}No debes hablarle así a una chica.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:03.58,0:08:06.00,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Hey guys, let's all just calm down.}Oigan chicos, vamos a calmarnos.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:06.00,0:08:07.21,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'm finished.}Terminé.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:08.75,0:08:10.05,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Same here.}Yo también terminé.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:10.05,0:08:11.30,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Huh?}¿Eh?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:11.30,0:08:13.59,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{What just happened?}¿Qué fue lo que pasó?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:15.22,0:08:17.64,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Futaba-chan, don't let that get you down.}Futaba-chan, no te deprimas.{~}{:omg: su voz}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:17.64,0:08:19.72,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yuuri...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:20.18,0:08:23.85,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Well, at least Yuuri's nice.}Qué bien, al menos Yuuri es simpática.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:23.85,0:08:25.27,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{That was good.}Estuvo bueno.{.-.}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:25.27,0:08:27.27,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What a wonderful meal.}Qué comida tan rica.{.-.}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:27.27,0:08:29.36,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{If you don't want it I'll take it.}Si no lo quieres, lo tomaré.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:30.78,0:08:34.70,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I was specially saving it for later...}Lo dejé ahí especialmente para comerlo luego...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:35.57,0:08:41.41,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Curse you... I will have my vengeance...}Maldito... Tendré mi venganza...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:41.41,0:08:42.79,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What happened to you?!}¡¿Qué pasó?!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:48.21,0:08:51.17,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Thoughts, anyone?}Entonces ¿qué piensan?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:51.17,0:08:51.96,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,¿Murao-san?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:51.96,0:08:53.13,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I have nothing to say.}Nada que decir.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:53.13,0:08:53.88,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,¿Yuuri?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:53.88,0:08:55.97,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Huh? Um...}¿Eh? Bueno...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:55.97,0:08:57.22,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,¿Kominato-kun?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:57.22,0:08:59.93,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Cool, orienteering tomorrow.}¿La orientación es mañana?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:59.93,0:09:01.22,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kou...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.14,0:09:05.73,lawless,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\bord3\fs70\shad1\4a&HCC&\3c&H27CBEE&\1c&H27C7EA&\pos(649.867,143.4)}Sin autoridad{\alpha&HFF&\t(280,280,\alpha&H00&\4a&HCC&)} alguna
Dialogue: 1,0:09:02.14,0:09:05.73,lawless,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0.6\fs70\c&H000000&\4a&HCC&\pos(649.867,143.4)}Sin autoridad{\alpha&HFF&\t(280,280,\alpha&H00&\4a&HCC&)} alguna
Dialogue: 10,0:09:03.23,0:09:05.73,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{They're so useless...}Son tan inútiles...{me gusta más así}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:05.73,0:09:11.23,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Come on, say something! "What do you believe the purpose of school events is?"}¡Vamos, digan algo! "¿Con qué propósito se realizan los eventos escolares?".
Dialogue: 10,0:09:11.23,0:09:14.82,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{We might be picked to present on it later!}¡Podríamos ser elegidos para presentarlo después!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:14.82,0:09:17.32,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Just write something noncommittal.}Solo escribe algo fácil de entender.{luego pasará}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:24.25,0:09:27.67,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Which class wants to go first?}¿Qué clase quiere hacerlo primero?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:27.67,0:09:31.67,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Let's see... how about 2-2?}Veamos... ¿Qué tal la clase 2-2?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:34.67,0:09:36.18,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Futaba-chan.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:36.18,0:09:38.59,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What, didn't you write something?}Lo escribiste, ¿no es así?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:38.59,0:09:40.35,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Just say that.}Simplemente debes leerlo.
