Dialogue: 10,0:09:54.40,0:09:56.53,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{In regard to school events,}Con respecto a los eventos de la escuela,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:57.91,0:10:03.79,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{\q2}{we believe that when students partake in events with objectives that can only be accomplished in a group,}creemos que cuando los estudiantes participan en eventos\N cuyos objetivos solo pueden conseguirse en grupo,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:03.79,0:10:06.46,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{they will feel a sense of community belonging}sentirán que son parte del grupo mismo
Dialogue: 10,0:10:06.46,0:10:12.21,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{\q2}{and be more inclined to cooperate with their classmates.}y estarán más dispuestos a ayudar a sus compañeros.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:07.21,0:10:12.21,AoHaru alt,,0,0,0,,{\i1\q2}{I can't believe how well he can make stuff up on the spot.}Vaya, es increíble lo bien que sabe improvisar.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:12.21,0:10:12.67,AoHaru alt,,0,0,0,,{\i1\q2\move(640,629,640,685)}{I can't believe how well he can make stuff up on the spot.}Vaya, es increíble lo bien que sabe improvisar.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:12.63,0:10:13.30,AoHaru alt,,0,0,0,,{\i1\q2\pos(,640,685)}{I can't believe how well he can make stuff up on the spot.}Vaya, es increíble lo bien que sabe improvisar.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:13.30,0:10:17.63,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Very good. Next up is...}Muy bien. El siguiente será...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:17.63,0:10:19.09,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Just a moment.}Un momento.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:19.76,0:10:23.06,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I don't feel like I completely understand your point.}No entendí completamente tu punto.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:23.97,0:10:26.43,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You are the biggest pain.}Qué molesto eres.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:27.35,0:10:30.44,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Why do you believe cooperation is so important?}¿Por qué crees que cooperar sea tan importante?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:30.44,0:10:33.44,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What? Well, that's...}¿Qué? Pues, eso es...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:34.32,0:10:40.41,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Cooperation allows for accomplishments greater than those one can achieve alone.}Cooperar permite alcanzar objetivos mucho\N mayores de los que puede alcanzar uno solo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.41,0:10:43.37,handwrite3,,0,0,0,,{\frz344.3\fs52\blur0.6\c&H4D4C4C&\pos(688.999,459.666)}¡Recuerdos divertidos!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:49.50,0:10:50.62,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,¿Kou?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:52.54,0:10:53.59,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{One day...}Un día...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:55.25,0:11:00.01,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{One day, when we look back on this, I want everyone who shared this experience}Un día, {AHR #03 [0:23:26.30]}cuando miremos atrás,\N quiero que todos los que compartieron esta experiencia
Dialogue: 10,0:11:00.01,0:11:04.18,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{to remember these warm and fun times.}recuerden lo cálido y divertido que fue.{AHR #03 [0:23:32.51]}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:06.43,0:11:08.14,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Sounds good to me.}Me parece bien.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:08.14,0:11:10.60,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You can sit down now.}Bien, ya puedes sentarte.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:12.98,0:11:15.94,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You look like a deer in headlights.}¿Por qué me miras de esa manera?{}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:15.94,0:11:18.28,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You're the one who wrote it.}Tú fuiste quien lo escribió.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:39.84,0:11:41.38,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,¿Yoshioka?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:41.68,0:11:43.76,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You write your essay yet?}¿Todavía no terminas tu ensayo?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:46.35,0:11:48.97,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Not a word, huh.}Ni una palabra.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:48.97,0:11:51.31,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Just write something noncommittal.}Simplemente escribe algo que te haga quedar bien.{}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:52.81,0:11:55.48,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You really amaze me, Kou.}Realmente me sorprendes, Kou.{sugoi sugoi}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:55.48,0:11:56.61,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{How so?}¿Qué dices?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:56.61,0:11:59.82,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Todo te sale tan natural.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:59.82,0:12:01.70,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I try my hardest, too.}Y yo no puedo aunque me esfuerce.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:03.28,0:12:06.53,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{It just always seems to come back and bite me.}Pareciera que todo lo que intento me sale mal.{del mangu}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:07.70,0:12:10.41,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I want to be more like you.}Quisiera ser más como tú.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:11.25,0:12:13.67,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Why do I keep failing?}¿Por qué me sigo equivocando?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:13.67,0:12:15.00,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'm so frustrated.}Es muy frustrante.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:20.13,0:12:22.34,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{There's no reason to be.}No hay razón para estarlo.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:23.97,0:12:27.60,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{It's not that I'm good at things, I'm just noncommittal.}No es que sea hábil en todo, \Nsimplemente no me comprometo.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:28.31,0:12:32.06,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You just see me that way because I couldn't care less.}Lo ves como si fuera fácil porque parece no importarme.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:34.65,0:12:37.48,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{But the fact that you're so beat up over this}Pero el hecho de que te sientas mal por estas cosas,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:38.19,0:12:41.11,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{is proof that you're not satisfied with where you are.}demuestra que no te satisface estar donde estás.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:48.16,0:12:49.08,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{So don't—}Por eso—
Dialogue: 10,0:12:59.71,0:13:04.93,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{A-Anyway, I think you've really got it all together.}Por eso... creo que eso te hace alguien de respeto.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:06.55,0:13:09.68,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{And you don't think you do?}¿Y no piensas lo mismo de ti?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:11.02,0:13:14.69,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'm just kind of good at going with the flow.}Solamente parezco ser bueno porque sigo la corriente.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:16.69,0:13:18.81,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{The back of his neck looked as familiar as ever,}Desde atrás, su cuello luce familiar como siempre,{nuca}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:22.82,0:13:25.99,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{but the words he said were not from someone I knew.}pero las palabras que dijo no eran las de alguien que conociera.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:26.66,0:13:29.49,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'm fine the way things are.}Estoy bien así como están las cosas.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:31.16,0:13:32.20,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{For some reason...}Por alguna razón...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:33.37,0:13:35.79,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{...I feel like crying right now.}...tengo ganas de llorar ahora mismo.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:37.37,0:13:40.38,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{What made him change this much?}¿Qué lo hizo cambiar tanto?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:41.38,0:13:42.42,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I want to know.}Quiero saberlo.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:43.55,0:13:48.89,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{What happened to Kou in the three years we were separated?}¿Qué pasó con Kou en estos tres años que estuvimos separados?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:50.85,0:13:52.14,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I want to know.}Quiero saberlo.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:54.18,0:13:57.69,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{How did he take all the things that happened?}¿Cómo se tomó todo lo que le sucedió?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:00.19,0:14:01.36,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What're you doing?}¿Qué estás haciendo?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:02.40,0:14:04.99,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Just a second.}Solo un segundo.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:16.00,0:14:17.54,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Hey, listen.}Oye.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:18.46,0:14:19.46,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Tell me...}¿Será que yo...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:21.54,0:14:22.54,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Do you love me?}... te gusto?{lo dejé como se dice en todo shoujo 9T.T)7}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:38.35,0:14:44.11,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I want to know more about Kou, but is that love?}Quiero saber más sobre Kou...\Npero ¿significa eso que me gusta?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:44.78,0:14:49.07,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{\q2\Are my feelings towards the old Kou... or the new one?}Mis sentimientos de ahora,\N ¿son por el antiguo Kou... o por el nuevo?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:50.16,0:14:54.87,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{D-Did you really just say that?! How full of yourself are you?}¡¿Y-Y preguntas tan quitado de la pena?!\N Eres un engreído.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:55.49,0:14:57.04,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Don't be crazy.}No seas tonta.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:57.04,0:15:00.54,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{The only reason I asked was because you were stroking my head.}Solo pregunté porque me acariciabas el cabello.{pelo ewe}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:01.13,0:15:04.80,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Just so you know, I don't feel a single thing for you.}Para que lo sepas bien, no siento nada por ti.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:05.13,0:15:08.67,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You confused the heck out of me back there.}Intentas confundirme para volver a esos momentos.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:08.67,0:15:10.76,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I just had to make sure.}Tenía que asegurarme.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:10.76,0:15:15.51,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I don't like how you are now at all either.}Tampoco me gusta cómo eres ahora.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:17.10,0:15:18.02,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{It's just...}Es que...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:19.48,0:15:25.73,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{When I think about how you used to be, I can't help but wonder how you, well...}Cuando pienso en cómo solías ser, \Nno puedo evitar preguntarme cómo tú, pues...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:26.69,0:15:29.03,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Something inside me just can't accept—}Algo dentro de mí sencillamente no puede aceptar—
Dialogue: 10,0:15:29.03,0:15:30.99,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You've changed just as much as me.}Tú cambiaste tanto como yo.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:32.07,0:15:34.87,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Stop looking for the old me already.}Ya deja de buscar a mi viejo yo.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:35.70,0:15:37.70,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{It's just depressing.}Es deprimente.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:41.67,0:15:46.59,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Also, for someone pretending to try so hard to move forward,}Además, pretendes ser fuerte para salir adelante,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:46.59,0:15:48.51,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{you sure do cling to the past.}y seguramente sigues en el pasado.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:49.01,0:15:50.92,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You're pathetic.}Eres patética.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:54.05,0:15:56.72,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Wh-What the heck?}¿Q-Qué diablos?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:58.27,0:15:59.52,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I knew it...}Lo sabía...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:00.56,0:16:05.19,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{The Kou today is not the one I love!}¡Este Kou no es a quien amo!{gusta}
Dialogue: 10,0:16:19.91,0:16:21.50,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{How immature.}Qué inmadura.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:21.50,0:16:24.25,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What, you two fighting?}¿Qué pasa? ¿Se pelearon?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:24.25,0:16:25.21,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Not really.}Para nada.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:24.25,0:16:25.21,AoHaru alt,,0,0,0,,{Not really.}Para nada.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:26.46,0:16:29.42,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{That's exactly the kind of thing a couple would do!}¡Es exactamente lo que una pareja haría!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:29.42,0:16:31.30,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Who'd go out with that?}¿Quién haría algo como eso?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:29.42,0:16:31.30,AoHaru alt,,0,0,0,,{Who'd go out with that?}¿Quién haría algo como eso?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:31.30,0:16:35.14,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I can't tell if you're the same or total opposites.}No sé si son iguales o totalmente opuestos.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:35.14,0:16:35.76,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Right?}¿Cierto?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:39.97,0:16:42.18,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'm going to clean over there.}Iré a limpiar por allá.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:42.18,0:16:43.77,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What's with her?}¿Qué le pasa?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:43.77,0:16:45.40,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{She clearly hates you.}Claramente te odia.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:43.77,0:16:45.40,AoHaru alt,,0,0,0,,{She clearly hates you.}Claramente te odia.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:46.15,0:16:48.65,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You're not really fighting, are you?}Oigan, no están peleados, ¿verdad?{}
Dialogue: 10,0:16:52.57,0:16:54.32,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{My cupcake...}Mi magdalena...
