Dialogue: 10,0:17:02.16,0:17:05.50,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Go help the others, Murao.}Ve a ayudar a los demás, Murao.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:06.12,0:17:08.21,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{They have enough people over there.}Ya son muchos.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:09.34,0:17:10.96,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'll stay.}Me quedaré.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:12.92,0:17:16.18,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Murao, you need to get along with the others.}Murao, debes llevarte bien con los demás.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:16.72,0:17:19.81,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You can't say that you're be fine alone}No puedes decir que estás bien estando sola,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:19.81,0:17:23.18,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{until you've put in the effort to making a place for yourself.}si todavía no te esfuerzas en estar bien con otros.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:23.93,0:17:26.10,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I am putting in the effort.}Eso estoy intentando.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:33.69,0:17:36.95,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Murao, I'm a teacher.}Murao, soy un profesor.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:36.95,0:17:40.53,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I won't leave you as long as you're my student.}No me alejaré de ti mientras sigas siendo mi alumna.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:41.20,0:17:44.45,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{But in the same vein, we can't get any closer.}Pero por eso mismo, no podemos estar más cerca.{más cerca que eso :3}
Dialogue: 10,0:17:46.46,0:17:47.96,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I've told you that many times.}Ya lo dije muchas veces, ¿verdad?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:54.76,0:17:55.59,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Murao,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:58.18,0:18:00.05,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Go join everyone else.}ve con los demás.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:21.62,0:18:22.91,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Um...}Eh...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:32.46,0:18:34.05,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Damn Kou!}¡Maldito Kou!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:36.01,0:18:38.97,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Why am I so pissed off?}¿Por qué estoy tan enojada?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:39.80,0:18:41.14,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{You're pathetic.}Eres patética.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:43.72,0:18:47.23,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Oh... it's because he was right.}Ya veo... es porque tenía razón.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:48.39,0:18:52.36,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{He may have been right, but I'm}Puede que tenga razón, \N{still doing my best to change.}pero todavía me sigo esforzando para cambiar.{esta posición para el diálogo es muy estúpida ._.)}{por eso la cambié ah}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:53.23,0:18:57.36,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{All I need to do is keep moving forward! Yeah!}¡Todo lo que necesito hacer es seguir adelante! ¡Bien!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:57.94,0:18:59.82,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{First, I should make up with Kou!}¡Primero debo disculparme con Kou!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:05.41,0:19:06.62,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,¡Ah, Kou!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:13.84,0:19:16.30,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I-Is she confessing to him?}¿S-Se le confesará?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:17.01,0:19:19.47,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{She totally is!}¡Lo está haciendo!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:21.93,0:19:29.10,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{He went and called me pathetic, and now he's grinning like an idiot at that girl!}¿Qué le pasa? ¡Me llamó patética, y ahora está sonriendo como un idiota frente a otra chica!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:29.10,0:19:30.02,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Hello?}¿Hola?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:33.48,0:19:35.57,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{E-Excuse me!}¡D-Disculpen!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:35.57,0:19:36.48,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You a second-year?}¿Eres de segundo año?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:36.48,0:19:38.19,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Well aren't you aggressive!}¡Esto es una sorpresa! {Escuché ikinari http://jisho.org/words?jap=ikinari&eng=&dict=edict :T}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:38.19,0:19:39.65,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Um, no...}Ah, no...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:39.65,0:19:41.99,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You're pretty cute.}Eres muy linda.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:40.15,0:19:41.99,AoHaru alt,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{Crap, third-years...}Rayos, los de tercero...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:41.99,0:19:44.12,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Oh, you must want to ask me out!}¡Oh, seguro me quiere invitar a salir!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:44.12,0:19:44.66,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Huh?}¿Eh?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:44.66,0:19:46.03,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{No, it must be me.}No, debe ser a mí.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:46.03,0:19:48.16,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Doofus, there's no way.}Idiota, eso es imposible.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:48.16,0:19:49.20,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Same to you.}Lo mismo digo.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:49.54,0:19:51.04,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Then who's it gonna be?}Entonces ¿a quién será?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:51.04,0:19:52.17,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{It's me, man!}¡Será a mí!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:51.04,0:19:52.17,AoHaru alt,,0,0,0,,{Excuse me...}Oigan, chicos...{:3}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:56.67,0:19:58.09,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Sorry about that.}Si me disculpan...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:58.09,0:20:01.17,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{This is my girlfriend.}ella es mi novia.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:04.18,0:20:05.30,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Well...}Bueno...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:05.30,0:20:07.93,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{We didn't really mean to...}En verdad no pretendíamos nada...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:07.93,0:20:09.02,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I see.}Ya veo.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:09.60,0:20:10.35,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Well then.}Con permiso.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:16.57,0:20:18.53,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What're you doing, stupid?}¿Qué haces, estúpida?{owo idiota, tonta}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:18.53,0:20:21.99,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{It just kinda... happened.}Simplemente... pasó.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:21.99,0:20:23.95,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{How does that happen?}¿Y cómo fue que pasó?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:24.45,0:20:25.66,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You're the one who—}Es que tú—
Dialogue: 10,0:20:25.66,0:20:27.78,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What? What did I do?}¿Y ahora yo qué?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:29.29,0:20:33.96,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Sorry. I was just trying to shift the blame.}Perdón. Solo intentaba echarle la culpa alguien.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:45.14,0:20:48.76,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{How long are you going to hold my hand?}¿Por cuánto tiempo más sostendrás mi mano?{}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:49.14,0:20:50.35,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{A bit longer.}Un poco más.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:51.43,0:20:53.23,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Just bear with it.}Aguántate.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:53.89,0:20:57.19,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I don't really... mind that much...}En realidad... no es que me moleste...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:58.06,0:21:02.99,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{But you might get in trouble... if someone sees us...}Pero podrías tener problemas... si alguien me ve contigo...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:03.86,0:21:09.24,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{L-Like... your girlfriend, or something.}Como... tu novia, o algo así. {asfkasdlajsfalskda asldkasdasd :F <3}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:11.16,0:21:13.46,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{She might get the wrong impression.}Ella podría malinterpretarlo.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:15.42,0:21:18.79,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{No worries. I don't have anyone like that.}No te preocupes. No tengo novia.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:20.13,0:21:22.67,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{O-Oh, okay then.}O-Oh, mira tú.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:22.67,0:21:25.63,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Huh, never mind then.}Bueno, no importa entonces.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:32.89,0:21:33.98,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I see.}Ya veo.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:35.60,0:21:38.44,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I feel like a load's off my shoulders.}Siento que me he quitado un peso de encima.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:38.94,0:21:42.57,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Huh? Why can a single thing Kou says}¿Eh? ¿Por qué algo que diga Kou
Dialogue: 10,0:21:42.57,0:21:45.36,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{make me depressed or relieved?}me puede deprimir o aliviar?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:46.53,0:21:49.03,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Even though, right now...}Sin embargo, ahora mismo...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:49.66,0:21:52.70,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{...I don't even love Kou or anything.}no me gusta Kou ni nada parecido.{:noo:}
